    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41176,41396</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>エトス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ethos</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41088</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_119_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>で、できた……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I-I did it...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41180</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_119_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>すごいよ&lt;Mel&gt;！
あんな技があるなんて！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Amazing, &lt;MEL&gt;!
To think you were capable of such a
brilliant technique!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41292</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_119_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>秘奥義、だよ。
でも、まだ完璧に使いこなせるわけじゃないし</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's a Mystic Arte. Of course, I'm hardly
an old hand at this.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41400</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_119_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>やっぱ&lt;Mel&gt;らしいよ。
&lt;Dio&gt;だったら浮かれまくって大変</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, better you have it. Were it &lt;DIO&gt; I've
no doubt he'd get far too carried
away with it for his own good.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41468</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_119_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うふふ、そうだね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Heehee, yes, I can see that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41612</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_119_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも、いつでも出せる感じじゃないし、これに
頼りきらないように他の技もしっかり練習しなきゃ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't feel I can use this all the time, 
though. Better to train my other artes
so I don't rely on it as much!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
</SceneText>
